y day permanently." /><string id="seljuk_bard_opt" text="Listen to Ghazavat Epic from the Steppe Bard (100 Dinars)" /><string id="seljuk_bard_no_gold" text="Not enough gold (100 Dinars required)." /><string id="seljuk_bard_notif" text="The heroic Seljuk Ghazavat epic recited on the kopuz fired up your soldiers' hearts! (+15 Army Morale)" /><string id="seljuk_alp_arslan_greet" text="Valiant alp of the Ghazavat fields! Welcome, may your blade remain sharp and your order steadfast. The House of Seljuk bestows its blessing upon you. What do you seek?" /><string id="seljuk_ertugrul_greet" text="O companion of Gaza! A thousand greetings from the frontier of Sogut and the Kayi encampment. May your steel shine forever, what brings you to my tent?" /><string id="seljuk_nizam_greet" text="The blade of justice and state order is sharp, my child. May your service to the Grand Realm endure. Speak, I am listening." /><string id="seljuk_starter_notif" text="The Grand Seljuk Gazi Starter Pack has been credited to your inventory! (+2,500 Dinars, Noble Turkoman Horse, Composite Bow, and Armor Piercing Arrows)" /><string id="clan_seljuk_royal" text="House of Seljuk" /><string id="clan_nizamiye" text="Nizamiya Divan" /><string id="clan_danismend" text="Danishmendids Principality" /><string id="clan_artuk" text="Artuqids Principality" /><string id="clan_mengucek" text="Mengujekids Principality" /><string id="clan_saltuk" text="Saltukids Principality" /><string id="clan_caka" text="Chaka Bey Principality" /><string id="clan_ahlatsah" text="Ahlatshahs Principality" /><string id="clan_karaman" text="Karamanoğlu Principality" /><string id="clan_kayi_oguz" text="Kayi Tribe Alps" /><string id="clan_ahi_order" text="Ahi Order" />
